# SHA-256 checksums for vendored tokenizer files.
#
# Format: "<sha256>  <relative path>" (two spaces), verifiable with:
#     sha256sum -c tokenizers/checksums.sha256
#
# These lock the exact bytes fetched at the pinned revisions in
# scripts/fetch-tokenizers.sh. If a re-download does not match, the content
# changed upstream and must be reviewed (token counts may shift).
